WEBVTT

NOTE
Doomtrain - Runaway Train. Cursed train summon, multi-status.
Observed duration in reference video: ~34 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Doomtrain. Runaway Train.

00:02.500 --> 00:08.000
Spectral train tracks unfurl across the battlefield in red light.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
A black skull-faced steam locomotive hurtles in, smokestacks belching purple flame.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Skeletal wheels grind on the rails as the train barrels straight at the enemies.

00:20.000 --> 00:27.000
The engine plows through them, dragging cars of bone and chains behind.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
Each car streams a different curse over the field — poison, blindness, silence, sleep.

00:32.000 --> 00:35.000
Doomtrain whistles and vanishes down a phantom tunnel.
